                "tabs": [
                  {
                    "_id": "121fdd1",
                    "tab_title": "What is AI search visibility?",
                    "tab_content": "<p>AI search visibility is the share of AI-generated answers in which your brand is named or cited as a source. Unlike a blue-link ranking there is no position one — an assistant either includes you in its answer or it does not.</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "_id": "1229c08",
                    "tab_title": "Does this replace a rank tracker?",
                    "tab_content": "<p>A rank tracker tells you where a URL sits in a list of ten links. An answer engine returns one synthesised answer and a handful of sources. SuperTool measures the second — it does not track search positions today.</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "_id": "1233a3f",
                    "tab_title": "Do I need my own API keys?",
                    "tab_content": "<p>SuperTool runs the engine checks using the credentials configured on the deployment. There is no per-tenant credential store, so bringing your own provider keys is not supported on any plan.</p>"
                  },
                  {
                    "_id": "123d876",
                    "tab_title": "Will the WordPress plugin break my theme or SEO plugin?",
                    "tab_content": "<p>It is designed not to: no front-end CSS, and it takes over none of your existing metadata. It writes SEO fields through whichever plugin you already run — Yoast and Rank Math are both handled. That behaviour is covered by tests against a stubbed API, not yet against a live install, so treat it as beta.</p>"
                  }
                ],
